Regex is macOS 13. Light Touch's 13 uses go through BigSurCompat's CompatRegex (NSRegularExpression, ICU) with
the same patterns as raw strings; a match's groups read as match[1] where a Regex output reads match.1.
check/compat.sh runs each pattern on the text it reads.

